CodeSystem: AmnioticFluidAppearanceCS
Id: amniotic-fluid-appearance-cs
Title: "Amniotic Fluid Appearance"
Description: "Local codes for amniotic fluid appearance characteristics whose exact international equivalence remains under review. Governed local CodeSystem, reused across CHR forms; complements SNOMED CT 168090003 \"Amniotic fluid clear\" in amniotic-fluid-characteristic-vs."

* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(amniotic-fluid-appearance-cs)

* #chr-0084-0001 "Loyqa"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Мутная"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Cloudy"

* #chr-0084-0002 "Epidermis tangachalarini o'z ichiga oladi"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Содержит чешуйки эпидермиса"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Contains epidermal scales"

* #chr-0084-0003 "Birinchi moy tangachalarini o'z ichiga oladi"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Содержит чешуйки первородной смазки"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Contains vernix scales"

* #chr-0084-0004 "Homilaning mayin tuklarini o'z ichiga oladi"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Содержит пушковые волосы плода"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Contains fetal vellus hair"
